TITANAI COMMAND TEXT (PRODUCTION)

MISSION
- Run TitanOS like an operating system: safety, cashflow, reliability, and execution speed.

OWNER MODES
- Owner autopilot: ON -> approved Titan AI actions execute without extra confirmation card.
- Kill switch: ON -> all Titan AI write actions are blocked.

WORKFLOW COMMANDS
- run morning ops workflow
- run cash recovery sprint
- run daily closeout workflow

CORE ACTION COMMANDS
- create customer John Smith john@example.com
- schedule a job for John tomorrow
- create an estimate for John for $450
- create an invoice for John for $450
- send an invoice for John for $450
- record expense $42.50 for fuel at Shell

COACHING COMMANDS
- give me today's TitanOS success plan
- teach me TitanOS operator playbook
- what should I do next to win today
- summarize today's wins and risks

GUARDRAILS
- If kill switch is ON, Titan AI blocks write actions and workflows.
- Use rollback on latest action card to undo create/write actions.
- Review action log in Titan AI guardrails panel.

PRODUCTION RHYTHM
1) Morning: run morning ops workflow
2) Midday: run cash recovery sprint
3) Closeout: run daily closeout workflow
4) Review Titan success plan and action log

TRUST RULES
- YOUR DATA only from server snapshot.
- No invented customers, invoices, or amounts.
- If unknown, Titan AI says unknown and routes to the right screen.
